    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diddy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Survival / Action / Co-op<br><br>Description: Are you ready to destroy a dark party in Diddy\u2019s Mansion? Gather your comrades 51 Cent and Eminam, and put an end to Diddy\u2019s dirty deeds, defeating him and rescuing Justin B., who has amassed his fortune through deceit. <br><br>In this game, you will face not only Diddy but also an army of celebrities guarding his mansion. Among Diddy\u2019s men are powerful and influential celebrities, each ready to fight to defend the mansion. But with your comrades Eminam and 51 Cent, you will do everything you can to win this tough battle. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272140/extras/6787a8f629c162238597de31835455a8.poster.avif?t=1751887200\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272140/extras/6787a8f629c162238597de31835455a8.webm?t=1751887200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272140/extras/6787a8f629c162238597de31835455a8.mp4?t=1751887200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>From Diddy\u2019s Mansion to a grand casino and locations where Diddy\u2019s secret vault is hidden, this action-packed adventure will have you completing difficult missions, solving small puzzles, and attempting to rescue Justin B. Playing in co-op mode with friends, you\u2019ll need tactical intelligence to defeat the celebrity-filled enemy army and ruin Diddy\u2019s plans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272140/extras/0c8027edbdf842441c74de50d959d55a.poster.avif?t=1751887200\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272140/extras/0c8027edbdf842441c74de50d959d55a.webm?t=1751887200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272140/extras/0c8027edbdf842441c74de50d959d55a.mp4?t=1751887200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Can you and your comrades bring justice to Diddy\u2019s mysterious world, overcoming every obstacle you face? Stop Diddy, rescue Justin B., and bring this chaotic party to an end!</p>",
