.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272140/extras/0c8027edbdf842441c74de50d959d55a.webm?t=1751887200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272140/extras/0c8027edbdf842441c74de50d959d55a.mp4?t=1751887200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Can you and your comrades bring justice to Diddy\u2019s mysterious world, overcoming every obstacle you face? Stop Diddy, rescue Justin B., and bring this chaotic party to an end!</p>",
